    {
      "text": "$f$ is continuous only at $x=1$",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "$f$ is continuous at all points",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given, $f: R \\rightarrow R$\r\nand $\\quad f(2 x-1)=f(x), x \\in R$\r\nHence, $f$ is continuous at $x=1$ and $f(1)=1$"
